Chess piece artwork — Cburnett set
===================================

SVG files in this directory are the Wikipedia/Wikimedia "t45" chess pieces
by Colin M. L. Burnett ("Cburnett"):

  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:SVG_chess_pieces

